  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喵茸好像對蒂安希進化石\n感到興趣。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B58338597D50CF5C0D84825B895E0C9032531677F3000A611F523082088DA330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵喵？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B555B5FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B5FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也許是喵茸接收到了\n某種心靈感應。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F8A31662F55B5833863A5653652304E86000A67D07A2E5FC39748611F61C9300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喵茸能夠將某個對象的想法\n傳達給其他的對象喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B5833880FD59205C0767D0500B5C0D8C61768460F36CD5000A50B390547D6651764ED676845C0D8C615594300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為那會消耗很多體力，\n所以我拜託牠不要用那份能力。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但牠偶爾還是會像這樣感應到某些東西。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA90A367036D8880175F88591A9AD4529BFF0C000A62404EE5621162DC8A1772604E0D8981752890A34EFD80FD529B300200100001BE00000A4F4672605076723E9084662F670350CF90196A23611F61C9523067D04E9B6771897F300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說這真是令人好奇呢。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n喵茸牠難道是捕捉到\n蘊藏在蒂安希進化石裡的意念？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAA9019771F662F4EE44EBA597D59475462300200100001BE01000A55B58338726096E39053662F635563495230000A860A85CF572884825B895E0C9032531677F388E17684610F5FF5FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，我們跟著喵茸，\n看牠是想要去哪裡吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C621150118DDF845755B58338FF0C000A770B7260662F60F3898153BB54EA88E15427300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠好像是正在感應著什麼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7260597D50CF662F6B635728611F61C984574EC09EBC300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳等一下喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B37B494E004E0B5594300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喂？蓋瑪？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5582FF1F84CB746AFF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我正在和喵茸進行調查，\n說不定會需要大家幫一把。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116B635728548C55B583389032884C8ABF67E5FF0C000A8AAA4E0D5B9A67039700898159275BB65E6B4E00628A300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯，拜託妳跟艾白兒、\n馬爾默他們說一聲囉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF0C62DC8A1759B38DDF827E767D51523001000A99AC723E9ED84ED650118AAA4E00807256C9300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "抱歉抱歉，我想跟多年以來的\n夥伴們先說一聲。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62B16B4962B16B49FF0C621160F38DDF591A5E744EE54F867684000A59254F34501151488AAA4E008072300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多年以來的？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "591A5E744EE54F867684FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "夥伴們？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59254F345011FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯，我不是第2任的所長嗎？\n我的前任是個叫做帥哥的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF0C62114E0D662F7B2C00324EFB76846240957755CEFF1F000A62117684524D4EFB662F500B53EB505A5E2554E576844EBA300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以才叫帥哥偵探事務所？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5624D53EB5E2554E5507563A24E8B52D96240FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "事務所名字裡的那個？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8B52D96240540D5B5788E1768490A3500BFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒錯！他超級體貼，\n還教了我讀書寫字之類的……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92932FFF014ED68D857D1A9AD48CBCFF0C000A908465594E8662118B8066F85BEB5B574E4B985E76842026202600100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但因為他隸屬國際警察，\n為解決事件而去了很遠的地方，<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4656E070BA4ED696B85C6C570B969B8B665BDFFF0C000A70BA89E36C7A4E8B4EF6800C53BB4E865F8890607684573065B9FF0C00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我才會在剛才提到的夥伴們\n還有喵茸的協助下，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n勉勉強強擔任著第2任的所長。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE56211624D67035728525B624D63D05230768459254F345011000A9084670955B583387684535452A94E0BFF0C00100001BE00000A52C952C95F375F3764D44EFB84577B2C00324EFB768462409577300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "特別是喵茸牠的心靈感應很厲害，\n有很多難搞的事件，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n都是靠牠的能力才順利解決的呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72795225662F55B58338726076845FC39748611F61C95F8853B25BB3FF0C000A67095F88591A96E3641E76844E8B4EF6FF0C00100001BE00000A90FD662F97607260768480FD529B624D9806522989E36C7A76845462FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過就像剛才我告訴<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的，\n過度使用的話，是會讓喵茸累垮的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904E5C3150CF525B624D6211544A8A3400100003110000FF01014F6059B37684FF0C000A904E5EA64F7F752876848A71FF0C662F67038B9355B583387D2F57AE7684300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵喵？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B555B5FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B5FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我們也追上去吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A621150114E5F8FFD4E0A53BB5427FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喵茸，你該不會是\n察覺到我的心情了？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B58338FF0C4F608A724E0D6703662F000A5BDF89BA5230621176845FC360C54E86FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也許是喵茸的能力使然……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F8A31662F55B58338768480FD529B4F7F7136202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "瑪琪艾兒的想法\n漸漸浮現在腦中……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n………………\n………………<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n喵茸牠怎麼了？\n話說，我肚子好餓啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n………………\n………………",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "746A742A827E5152768460F36CD5000A6F386F386D6E73FE572881664E2D2026202600100001BE01000A202620262026202620262026000A20262026202620262026202600100001BE01000A55B583387260600E9EBC4E86FF1F000A8A718AAAFF0C6211809A5B50597D9913554A300200100001BE01000A202620262026202620262026000A2026202620262026202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "瑪琪艾兒？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "746A742A827E5152FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "妳餓了嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59B399134E8655CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘿嘿嘿，\n我好像有點餓了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "563F563F563FFF0C000A6211597D50CF67099EDE99134E86300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝喔，喵茸。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D5594FF0C55B58338300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "既然如此，\n我們就補充一下熱量吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E2713659826B64FF0C000A621150115C3188DC51454E004E0B71B191CF5427300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真是太好吃了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F662F592A597D54034E86FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，喵茸，\n告訴我們你剛才是想去哪裡吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C55B58338FF0C000A544A8A34621150114F60525B624D662F60F353BB54EA88E15427300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵喵？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B555B5FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B5FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我們也追上去吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A621150114E5F8FFD4E0A53BB5427FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喵茸，你怎麼在\n全像傳送梯前面停下來了？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B58338FF0C4F60600E9EBC5728000A516850CF50B3900168AF524D9762505C4E0B4F864E86FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵喵。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B555B530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B5FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你想去上面，是吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6060F353BB4E0A9762FF0C662F5427FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B5FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來我們就要到囉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F86621150115C318981523056C9300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我先到上面去等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A6211514852304E0A976253BB7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B35594FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿4",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喵茸你感應到的就是這裡，\n沒錯吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B583384F60611F61C9523076845C31662F901988E1FF0C000A6C92932F5427FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B5FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超級結晶未免也太多了。\n怎麼看都不對勁。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D857D1A7D506676672A514D4E5F592A591A4E863002000A600E9EBC770B90FD4E0D5C0D52C1300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵喵～喵！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B555B5FF5E55B5FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "小碎鑽……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0F788E947D2026202600100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "另一隻寶可夢是……？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 2912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E64E0096BB5BF653EF5922662F20262026FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說不定和<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的超級石\n有什麼關係？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 2944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA4E0D5B9A548C00100003110000FF01014F6059B376848D857D1A77F3000A67094EC09EBC95DC4FC2FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B5FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "究竟和超級石有沒有關係，\n得要捉起來確認看看才是！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7A767ADF548C8D857D1A77F367096C92670995DC4FC2FF0C000A5F97898163498D774F8678BA8A8D770B770B624D662FFF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵喵～喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B555B5FF5E559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蒂～啊！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8482FF5E554AFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿A",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳得要捉住牠啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35F97898163494F4F7260554AFF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "別打倒，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳得要捉住牠啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "522562535012FF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B35F97898163494F4F7260554AFF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "恭喜！\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳果然是高手。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "606D559CFF01000A001000020100000000100003110000FF01014F6059B3679C7136662F9AD8624B300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我說，<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n讓我看看剛才那隻寶可夢吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118AAAFF0C0010000201000000FF0C000A8B936211770B770B525B624D90A396BB5BF653EF59225427300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好漂亮……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 3320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D6F024EAE20262026FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這光芒，\n會讓我想起百刻日晷呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 3344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901951498292FF0C000A67038B93621160F38D77767E523B65E566775462FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "百刻？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 3388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "767E523BFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "日晷？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 3396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E56677FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯，在叫做百刻市的地方\n有個神秘的日晷儀。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n聽說它和超級石有關係。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 3404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF0C572853EB505A767E523B5E027684573065B9000A6709500B795E79D8768465E566775100300200100001BE00000A807D8AAA5B83548C8D857D1A77F3670995DC4FC2300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這下子讓我想起了好多事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E0B5B508B93621160F38D774E86597D591A4E8B300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我跟<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳說喔，\n在帥哥他離開之後，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我自己也認識了某些人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 3524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118DDF00100003110000FF01014F6059B38AAA5594FF0C000A57285E2554E54ED696E2958B4E4B5F8CFF0C00100001BE00000A621181EA5DF14E5F8A8D8B584E8667D04E9B4EBA300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一個是AZ，\n另一個是布拉塔諾博士。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 3608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00500B662F0041005AFF0C000A53E64E00500B662F5E0362C958548AFE535A58EB300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這個博士是專門研究超級進化的，\n他也曾經和AZ這麼說過……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 3656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019500B535A58EB662F5C08958078147A768D857D1A903253167684FF0C000A4ED64E5F66FE7D93548C0041005A90199EBC8AAA904E2026202600100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也許是3000年前發射的\n最終兵器的光芒……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n也就是傳說的寶可夢的力量，\n灑落在石頭上，讓石頭變成了超級石。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 3724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F8A31662F00330030003000305E74524D767C5C047684000A67007D42517556687684514982922026202600100001BE01000A4E5F5C31662F50B38AAA76845BF653EF59227684529B91CFFF0C000A7051843D572877F3982D4E0AFF0C8B9377F3982D8B8A62104E868D857D1A77F3300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當時AZ也點頭同意。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n他說正因為那樣，所以最近\n才會開始發現新種類的超級石。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 3848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "757666420041005A4E5F9EDE982D540C610F300200100001BE01000A4ED68AAA6B6356E070BA90A36A23FF0C62404EE567008FD1000A624D6703958B59CB767C73FE65B07A2E985E76848D857D1A77F3300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……畢竟，最終兵器\n在5年前也被使用過嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 3940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202675627ADFFF0C67007D4251755668000A572800355E74524D4E5F88AB4F7F7528904E561B300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 3992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B5202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喵茸，不會有事的。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n密阿雷有<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā他她在，\n還有我在呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 4004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B58338FF0C4E0D670367094E8B7684300200100001BE01000A5BC6963F96F76709001000020100000000100003110000FF01014ED659795728FF0C000A90846709621157285462FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n這隻寶可夢<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也要好好照顧牠喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 84,
      "offsetInSection": 4088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A901996BB5BF653EF592200100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F8981597D597D7167986772605594300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷需要像<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這樣\n能和各種寶可夢們建立牽絆的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 4152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F79700898150CF00100003110000FF01014F6059B390196A23000A80FD548C54047A2E5BF653EF592250115EFA7ACB727D7D4676844EBA300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，\n我們回帥哥偵探事務所去了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 4224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C000A6211501156DE5E2554E5507563A24E8B52D9624053BB4E86300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對了！AZ他還提到一件事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 4268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E86FF010041005A4ED6908463D052304E004EF64E8B300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在他尋找花葉蒂的漫長旅途中……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n他還曾經在遙遠的豐緣地區\n見過堪稱是超級進化起源的現象！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 4304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57284ED65C0B627E82B18449848276846F2B957765C590144E2D2026202600100001BE01000A4ED6908466FE7D9357289059906076848C507DE357305340000A898B904E582A7A31662F8D857D1A903253168D776E90768473FE8C61FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以AZ他才會\n把寶可夢與人類的牽絆放在心上，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n一直一直地思考著這件事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 4408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE50041005A4ED6624D6703000A628A5BF653EF592282074EBA985E7684727D7D46653E57285FC34E0AFF0C00100001BE00000A4E0076F44E0076F45730601D8003845790194EF64E8B300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n以後有什麼事時，也請多指教喔！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n拜拜～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 4496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A4EE55F8C67094EC09EBC4E8B6642FF0C4E5F8ACB591A630765595594FF0100100001BE01000A62DC62DCFF5EFF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    }
  ],
